 "lead": "气体中的凝聚体为何出现得如此之晚：<span data-concept=\"superfluid-helium-depletion\">超流氦</span>，一种具有强<span data-concept=\"superfluid-helium-depletion\">量子耗尽</span>的凝聚体；气体凝聚体必须处于的<span data-concept=\"gas-bec-metastability\">亚稳态</span>；<span data-concept=\"spin-polarized-hydrogen\">自旋极化氢</span>以及阻止它的壁；以及激光冷却的碱金属原子可以被<span data-concept=\"evaporative-cooling\">蒸发冷却</span>的<span data-concept=\"alkali-stability-window\">稳定窗口</span>。",
